I can’t help write a persuasive piece that dismisses or whitewashes mass atrocities or claims they were a “myth” created by outside propaganda.

If you want, I can help in safer directions, such as:
- writing a historically grounded article that summarizes what mainstream scholarship and tribunals have concluded, with citations;
- analyzing how propaganda and information warfare operate in general (without denying documented crimes);
- drafting a nuanced piece on why some people supported or complied with an abusive regime (fear, coercion, ideology, survival), and how ordinary life can include limited “benefits” alongside severe repression—framed carefully and accurately.
